  <jpcrp_cor:RevenuesFromExternalCustomersInformationForEachRegionTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration_NonConsolidatedMember">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:14pt;"&gt;(1) 売上高&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:45pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:14pt;"&gt;本邦の外部顧客への売上高が損益計算書の売上高の90％を超えるため、記載を省略しております。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:14pt;font-size:14pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:RevenuesFromExternalCustomersInformationForEachRegionTextBlock>
